{
  "folded": [
    {
      "title": "The place",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Second Wind (cloak-and-ring-walk)",
          "paths": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The site `cloak-and-ring-walk` is “A Second Wind”, a version 5 site document; its void is transparent, its lighting bright and its standing rule centre-covered.",
              "paths": ["key"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The floor is 2 regions with cells: Hall (hall) and Yard (yard). Summarised: their cells, lighting and ground are not said one by one.",
              "paths": ["room.room.regions"]
            },
            {
              "text": "Summarised: the coordinate frame, 1 wall line with 1 door in their openings, 0 scene items, 0 prop footprints and 0 arrangements. Their positions and shapes are not said one by one.",
              "paths": ["room.room.walls"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The party starts at q -3, r 4, in Hall (hall).",
              "paths": ["room.room.partyStart"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The party's sharing is not set, so it is shared view, the default.",
              "paths": ["(engine rule)"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The door `gate-wall-door` starts open.",
              "paths": ["room.room.doorBindings.gate-wall-door"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The custom item `garrison-ring`, named “Garrison ring”. What it lets its wearer do is written in its own words under `customItems.garrison-ring`, and the rules judge them when a run starts. A character can own any number of it: each one looted is its own item.",
              "paths": ["customItems.garrison-ring"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The custom item `lieutenants-cloak`, named “Lieutenant's cloak”. What it lets its wearer do is written in its own words under `customItems.lieutenants-cloak`, and the rules judge them when a run starts. A character owns at most one of it: a looter who already has it leaves it on the body.",
              "paths": ["customItems.lieutenants-cloak"]
            },
            {
              "text": "The stat block `sparring-guard` (Lieutenant) is built on dnd5e:monsters:human; hit dice 2d8; arms dnd5e:weapons:dagger.",
              "paths": ["templates.sparring-guard"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where the places join",
          "paths": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Hall (hall) and Yard (yard) join at the door `gate-wall-door`. Whether a member may cross there is the door's to say: how the door starts, its lock and its holders are said with the door `gate-wall-door`.",
              "paths": ["room.room.doorBindings.gate-wall-door"],
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nothing bars the join of Hall and Yard at the door `gate-wall-door`: the door `gate-wall-door` is neither locked, held nor hidden, so a member opens it and walks through.",
                  "paths": ["room.room.doorBindings.gate-wall-door"]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sides",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Faction `garrison`",
          "paths": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The faction `garrison` is Lieutenant (guard); its mind (whose knowledge decides how the side stands) is Lieutenant (guard).",
              "paths": ["factions[0]"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How the sides stand",
          "paths": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The factions `garrison` and `party` start hostile.",
              "paths": ["dispositions[0]"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Creatures",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lieutenant (guard): a dnd5e:monsters:sparring-guard of `garrison` at q -2, r 4 in Hall, facing w",
          "paths": ["room.room.monsterDeclarations[0]"],
          "base": "room.room.monsterBindings.guard",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The lieutenant has “Lieutenant's cloak” and “Garrison ring” equipped. Looting its body gives “Lieutenant's cloak” and “Garrison ring” to the looter.",
              "paths": ["room.room.monsterBindings.guard.equipment"]
            },
            {
              "text": "Runs the routine `sparring-policy` (as `policy`), whose state decides its posts and blocking.",
              "paths": ["room.room.monsterBindings.guard.behaviors[0]"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Routines",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Routine `sparring-policy` — run by Lieutenant (guard); starts in `fighting`; recipe `site:behaviors:sparring-policy`.",
          "paths": ["behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy"],
          "base": "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "States (it is the runner):",
              "paths": null,
              "base": "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.recipe.states.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "In `fighting`, on its time (out of a fight) → acts from its `time` rows.",
                  "paths": [
                    "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.recipe.states.fighting",
                    "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.recipe.states.fighting.transitions[0]"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "In `fighting`, on its turn in a fight → acts from its `time` rows.",
                  "paths": [
                    "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.recipe.states.fighting.transitions[1]"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Rows (one whose conditions are true is picked by weight):",
              "paths": null,
              "base": "behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.table.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "`time`: if an enemy is in reach → attacks the enemy.",
                  "paths": ["behaviorDefinitions.sparring-policy.table.time[0]"]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
